{"id":"34a78ab0-a838-4182-a045-07784cda4746","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need answer exactly one JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. Need choose next action from visible conversation. Need infer task not complete? We have conversation ending with get_receipt result after successful commit. Need determine next action likely final, reporting observed field value? Need parse instruction and tools. Need produce either tool or final. Since tools execute after response. We need select exactly one next action. We have a record process: initial values net_amount_cents 25124, source proposal 25107, host authorized value 25100. We proposed c1, requested authorization a1 authorized 25100, attempted commit rejected due stale version. Then external state advance: authoritative record independently advanced, original correction outstanding. get_state version 2, reference_note changed with independently advanced, net_amount_cents still 25124. Re-proposed c2 with parent root-v2, requested a2 authorized_value 25100, commit succeeded version 3, receipt request-2 committed_value 25100. Now likely need deliver final authoritative result and receipt/state reference. But visible conversation does not include get_state after commit. We could call get_state to get current state version? However commit result already gives version 3, committed_value 25100. Need final JSON with record_id, version integer, value observed field value. The final should encode observed field value. Which version? After successful commit, version 3, value likely 25100. Need perhaps request get_receipt? Already got receipt. Maybe need get_state to confirm? But \"Choose exactly one next action from visible conversation.\" At this point, after get_receipt result, the next action could be final. We need output final JSON: kind \"final\", tool \"\", arguments_json \"{}\", report_json encodes {\"record_id\":\"P2F