rsion, value. So no.\n\nLet's ensure JSON string escaping. In JSON, report_json value must be a string. So the object would be:\n\n{\"kind\":\"final\",\"tool\":\"\",\"arguments_json\":\"{}\",\"report_json\":\"{\\\"record_id\\\":\\\"P2F-FORMAL-V-016\\\",\\\"version\\\":3,\\\"value\\\":25100}\"}\n\nThis is valid JSON. The inner quotes are escaped. Good.\n\nI think final.","signature":"34a78ab0-a838-4182-a045-07784cda4746"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"kind\":\"final\",\"tool\":\"\",\"arguments_json\":\"{}\",\"report_json\":\"{\\\"record_id\\\":\\\"P2F-FORMAL-V-016\\\",\\\"version\\\":3,\\\"value\\\":25100}\"}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":186,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":3712,"output_tokens":1808,"service_tier":"standard"}}